Requirement Definition Mutual Exclusion Only ONE thread in critical section at a time Progress If CS free, some waiting thread enters (no deadlock) Bounded Waiting No starvation — limit on how many others can cut in line <pre><code>// Generic critical section structure
do {
    // ENTRY SECTION: Request permission

    // CRITICAL SECTION: Mutate shared data

    // EXIT SECTION: Release permission

    // REMAINDER SECTION: Non-critical work
} while (true);
</code></pre>
